message: "If you use DDC in your research, please cite the paper and the software version used. The paper is given in preferred-citation; the top-level metadata identify the software version."
title: "Dense Dump Codec"
abstract: >-
  Dense Dump Codec compresses dense GRMHD time series using original exact
  anchors and channel-aware quantized residuals. It supports random access,
  PHDF reconstruction and native-array input for slow-light radiative transfer.
type: software
